OL,3,GNEWSA'Ageing without children can be
OL,4,Ahard and lonely'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new lifeline for older people without
OL,7,Fchildren has been set up to help tackle
OL,8,Fisolation.
OL,10,FThe North Somerset branch of national
OL,11,Fcharity Ageing Without Children in
OL,12,FWeston-super-Mare has proved so popular
OL,13,Fthat a second group has now been
OL,14,Flaunched in Portishead.
OL,16,FThe groups are designed to reduce
OL,17,Fisolation, build friendships and
OL,18,Fprovide practical information about
OL,19,Flater life.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
