OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1791179786
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSA'Ageing without children can be
OL,4,Ahard and lonely'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMike Davis, 79, a widower from
OL,7,FClevedon, said at the sessions he talks
OL,8,Fwith "like-minded people", adding:
OL,9,F"I've got a lot of friends and a busy
OL,10,Fsocial life, but life can be hard and
OL,11,Flonely, especially in the evenings."
